/place/Curzon\\u002BKingston/@51.4116033,-0.306894,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x48760bead293e8ed:0xe4bafdfdac7c22d3!8m2!3d51.4116!4d-0.3047\"},\"gettingHereCTALink\":{\"name\":\"Get directions\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"url\":\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/place/Curzon\\u002BKingston/@51.4116033,-0.306894,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x48760bead293e8ed:0xe4bafdfdac7c22d3!8m2!3d51.4116!4d-0.3047\"},\"gettingHereHeading\":\"Getting Here\",\"gettingHereImage\":{\"fromLeft\":50.0,\"fromTop\":50.0,\"url\":\"/media/oclj5oeb/kingston-bentall-map.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"gettingHereInfoText\":\"Nearby parking:\\n\\nCurzon Kingston is located in The Bentall Centre which has 1,900 parking spaces across three multi-level, secure car parks \\u2013 A, B and Seven Kings.\\n\\nAll cinema-goers can claim 7 hours free parking in the Bentall Centre car parks from Monday-Friday. Please note, free parking is not available on the weekends or bank holidays.  \\n\\nValidate your parking ticket at the cinema bar before exit to receive this offer. Please note, once validated, you must leave the car park within 20 minutes or regular charges will apply.\",\"addressLine1\":\"The Bentall Centre\",\"addressLine2\":\"Wood St, Kingston upon Thames\",\"addressLine3\":\"\",\"city\":\"London\",\"postcode\":\"KT1 1TP\",\"nearestStationName\":\"Kingston\",\"nearestStationType\":\"national-rail\",\"cinemaSpecificBannerText\":\"\",\"foodAndBeverageEnabled\":false}"
