l Reckoning\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Light the fuse because Tom Cruise's world-saving super spy Ethan Hunt is back to complete a mission for the ages alongside Simon Pegg, Ving Rhames and Hayley Atwell. This propulsive action-adventure demands to be seen on the big screen.    \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Our lives are the sum of our choices. Tom Cruise is Ethan Hunt in Mission: Impossible – The Final Reckoning.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, injury detail, threat, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-21\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":170,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CUAQn2P13yY\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000029\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000030\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000436\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003183\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003189\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003192\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003193\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003194\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004434\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005130\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005592\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005596\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005686\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005718\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005719\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005720\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005721\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005722\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006663\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011114\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011115\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000349\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9246b245-546b-48f2-aa44-5143e8e5b45e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006096\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007516\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAn