antastic Four: First Steps” introduces Marvel’s First Family—Reed Richards/Mister Fantastic (Pedro Pascal), Sue Storm/Invisible Woman (Vanessa Kirby), Johnny Storm/Human Torch (Joseph Quinn) and Ben Grimm/The Thing (Ebon Moss-Bachrach) as they face their most daunting challenge yet. Forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, they must defend Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus (Ralph Ineson) and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer (Julia Garner). And if Galactus’ plan to devour the entire planet and everyone on it weren’t bad enough, it suddenly gets very personal. The action adventure also stars Paul Walter Hauser, John Malkovich, Natasha Lyonne and Sarah Niles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel Studios’ “The Fantastic Four: First Steps” introduces Marvel’s First Family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":130,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eW3Q8N42Bm0\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000708\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002970\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007262\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008478\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009722\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000581\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000582\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000583\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000035\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"970b06cc-4a61-4cd0-a256-565df86e1f40\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005983\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007383\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006221\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Kids Club: Dogs at the Opera\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"One day, a street dog named Samson in his attempts to hide from stray dog catchers finds himself at the Metropolitan Opera. There, he meets charming Margot. Margot is a pet of Anastasia, the theatre's prima ballerina. The plot thickens as the unique tiara that belonged to the queen of Great Britain and that Anastasia has to wear in the fourth act of the ballet, is stolen from the dressing room. Without the tiara, the show cannot go on and must be canceled. Now Margot and Samson have to find the thief, retrieve the tiara, and save the day to the sounds of the music by the great Georges Bizet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"One day, a street dog named Samson in his attempts to hide from stray dog catchers finds himself at the Metropolitan Opera. There, he meets charming Margot. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":75,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007739\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007742\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007744\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007745\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007747\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011505\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011506\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011507\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011508\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011509\",\"roles\